    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Lufthansa Business Class\n* Star Chefs *\nMenu",
      "Lufthansa Business Class\nLufthansa Business Class\nDinner\nBrunch\nFlight\nHors d'oeuvre\nMarinated Crayfish and Asparagus\nBreast of Chicken and Orzo Pasta\naccented by Pimento Sauce\nSalad\nFrisée and Arugula\nwith Bell Pepper Julienne and fresh Herbs\npresented with Basil Olive Oil Dressing\nBread, Rolls and Butter\nEntrees\nCabbage Roulade filled with Duck\nserved with creamy Polenta\nFillet of Cod\naccompanied by White Beans with Saffron\nand Pasta Pockets\nStir-fried Beef in spicy Oyster Sauce\nwith Vegetable Medley and Asian Egg Noodles\nFresh Fruit\nMango, Papaya, Pineapple, Lychees\nand Red Currants\nEntrees\nPlease choose one of the following:\nCold Gourmet Plate\nTurkey Ham with Paprika, Cottage Cheese,\nAllgäu Cheese, mixed Grains\nand smoked Salmon in Seaweed\nor\nHot Specialty\nVegetable Crêpe with Mousseline Sauce\nFrom the Bread Basket\na selection of Rolls, Croissant\nand Warm Pastry\nwith Butter and Preserves\nLast Minute\nBreakfast\nFlight\nCheese and Dessert\nPetit Breton, Castello Blue and Ash Goat Cheese\nserved with Grapes and toasted Pine Nuts\nPeppered Chocolate Mousse\nenhanced by Strawberry Rhubarb Compote\nFresh Fruit Salad\nCoffee or Tea\nOrange Juice\nCroissants\nLANDHAUS\nSt. URBAN\nChopsticks are available upon request.\nLANDHAUS\nSt. URBAN\nPlease accept our apology if occasionally your selection is not available.\n260C005-C\n260C005-C\nEnglish\nGetränke / Beverages"
    ],
